  "story": "A DJ plays a long list of tracks, each written as the number of its style, from 0 to 99. She wants to cut the night into sets, each a run of tracks next to each other, so that no style is heard in two different sets, and she wants as many sets as possible. Report the number of tracks in each set, in order. With styles 4 7 4 2 2 the sets are 4 7 4 and 2 2, so the answer is 3 2. An empty night has no sets.",
