    "maxBlocks": 85
  },
  "limits": {"maxOps": 10850, "maxDepth": 32, "maxAlloc": 450},
  "hints": ["A set that contains a style must run at least as far as the last track of that style. First find, for every style, the position where it is played for the last time.", "Walk through the tracks keeping the end of the current set: the MAX of the last positions of every style met in this set so far. Styles met on the way can push the end further.", "When your position is EQUAL to that end, the set closes here: APPEND its size, the position MINUS the set's first position PLUS 1, and the next set begins on the next track."],
